{"id":"631960","name":"葱油豆腐脑","author":"雨中漫步li","authorId":"10274398","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631960/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"自制豆腐脑","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豆腐脑提前做好。","img":"images/631960/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备好香葱:洋葱、姜。","img":"images/631960/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅内放油烧热，放入花椒、大料小火慢慢炸出香味。","img":"images/631960/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入洋葱、香葱、姜炸香。","img":"images/631960/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入原汁酱油。","img":"images/631960/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/631960/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放盐。","img":"images/631960/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"烧开。","img":"images/631960/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入适量清水，熬7分钟。","img":"images/631960/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"豆腐脑盛入碗里，放香菜、香葱。","img":"images/631960/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盛入酱油料汁。","img":"images/631960/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放老干妈。","img":"images/631960/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631960/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"香香的，美味好吃。","img":"images/631960/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}